    "title": "Union County Sheriff's Office receives donation for K9 Kona's ballistic vest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By David Jablonski ,\n11 hours ago UNION COUNTY — Union County Sheriff Peter Corvelli announced that Dr. Cesar DePaço has donated $3,800 to provide a ballistic vest for K9 Kona, helping protect the patrol-trained K9 during deployments throughout Union County. The donation follows Dr. DePaço’s recent visit to the Union County Sheriff’s Office canine... Read full article",
